@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@approveOrderId = 1
@rejectOrderId = 2
@completionPendingOrderId = 3

### 管理员登录（该账号必须拥有 ADMIN 角色）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_user_001",
  "password": "Ocean1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set(
        "adminAccessToken",
        response.body.data.accessToken
    );
%}

### 管理员查询待审核工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rescue-orders?status=PENDING_REVIEW&page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 管理员查询全部工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rescue-orders?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 审核通过并发布工单（修改为真实待审核工单 ID）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rescue-orders/{{approveOrderId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "decision": "APPROVED",
  "reviewComment": "信息真实，允许发布"
}

### 审核拒绝工单
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rescue-orders/{{rejectOrderId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "decision": "REJECTED",
  "reviewComment": "现场信息不完整"
}

### 非法工单状态，应返回业务错误 40012
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rescue-orders?status=UNKNOWN&page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### 管理员确认志愿者完成反馈
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rescue-orders/{{completionPendingOrderId}}/completion-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "decision": "CONFIRMED",
  "confirmComment": "完成情况符合要求"
}

### 管理员驳回完成反馈，工单返回 ACCEPTED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/rescue-orders/{{completionPendingOrderId}}/completion-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "decision": "REJECTED",
  "confirmComment": "完成照片不清晰，请重新提交"
}
